Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.46,0:02:31.59,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(160,0)\blur20\bord2\1a&HFF&}明日　きみと生きれるなら
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.59,0:02:34.51,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur20\bord2\1a&HFF&}毎日記念日にして祝おう
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.51,0:02:37.47,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,480)\blur20\bord2\1a&HFF&}あたりまえにある奇跡を
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.47,0:02:40.68,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(480,480)\blur20\bord2\1a&HFF&}決して忘れはしないように
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.91,0:02:43.89,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(160,0)\blur20\bord2\1a&HFF&}明日　きみと生きれるなら
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.89,0:02:47.02,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur20\bord2\1a&HFF&}明日　きみと話せるなら
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.02,0:02:50.02,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur20\bord2\1a&HFF&}明日　きみと笑えるなら
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.02,0:02:53.15,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur20\bord2\1a&HFF&}って思える　きみと出会えた
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.15,0:02:59.57,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\blur20\bord2\1a&HFF&}僕は　僕は　きっと　幸せものだ
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.57,0:03:06.48,OP_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,160)\blur20\bord2\1a&HFF&}僕は　僕は　幸せものだ
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.46,0:01:40.87,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(160,160)\blur20\bord2\1a&HFF&}我想要
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.87,0:01:43.91,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(160,160)\blur20\bord2\1a&HFF&}我想要见到你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.22,0:02:00.41,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(160,160)\blur20\bord2\1a&HFF&}等明天  清晨我睁开了双眼
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.41,0:02:03.52,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(160,0)\blur20\bord2\1a&HFF&}早上好  我一定要讲给你听
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.52,0:02:06.36,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,160)\blur20\bord2\1a&HFF&}我只要  听到你回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.63,0:02:09.77,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(160,0)\blur20\bord2\1a&HFF&}就一定  会说你回来了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.77,0:02:12.73,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur20\bord2\1a&HFF&}也会有  意见不同和你拌嘴
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.73,0:02:15.70,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur20\bord2\1a&HFF&}对不起  有时也会说这句话
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.70,0:02:19.28,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,400)\blur20\bord2\1a&HFF&}但那些  都是奇迹的一部分
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.28,0:02:22.29,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur20\bord2\1a&HFF&}想着想着  就这样见到你了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.29,0:02:27.67,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,700)\blur20\bord2\1a&HFF&}我真的  我真的  太喜欢太喜欢你了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.46,0:02:31.59,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(160,0)\blur20\bord2\1a&HFF&}等明天  还能和你共活的话
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.59,0:02:34.51,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur20\bord2\1a&HFF&}我愿意  每天都是纪念日呀
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.51,0:02:37.47,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,480)\blur20\bord2\1a&HFF&}我愿意  将那些平凡的奇迹
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.47,0:02:40.68,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(480,480)\blur20\bord2\1a&HFF&}都永远  镌刻在我心头之上
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.91,0:02:43.89,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(160,0)\blur20\bord2\1a&HFF&}等明天  还能和你共活的话
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.89,0:02:47.02,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur20\bord2\1a&HFF&}等明天  还能和你互语的话
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.02,0:02:50.02,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur20\bord2\1a&HFF&}等明天  还能和你同笑的话
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.02,0:02:53.15,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur20\bord2\1a&HFF&}想着想着  就这样见到你了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.15,0:02:59.57,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\blur20\bord2\1a&HFF&}你看我  你看我  已经无法更幸福了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.57,0:03:06.48,OP_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,160)\blur20\bord2\1a&HFF&}你看我  你看我  无法更幸福了
Dialogue: 5,0:22:21.57,0:22:27.62,ED_JP,,0,0,40,,{\fad(240,240)\an8\blur5}Everything melts into the dead of night
Dialogue: 5,0:22:27.62,0:22:32.87,ED_JP,,0,700,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur5}As if even gravity fades away
Dialogue: 5,0:22:33.63,0:22:39.13,ED_JP,,700,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur5}Enchanted by the smile like a spark
Dialogue: 5,0:22:39.13,0:22:43.68,ED_JP,,700,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur5}「寂しい」忘れちゃう夜だ
Dialogue: 5,0:22:45.89,0:22:52.14,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur5}くだらなく愛おしい話を聞かせて
Dialogue: 5,0:22:52.73,0:22:54.56,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur5}Dance with me？
Dialogue: 5,0:22:54.56,0:22:58.73,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur5}二人で無限の闇を
Dialogue: 5,0:22:58.73,0:23:04.53,ED_JP,,0,0,40,,{\fad(240,240)\blur5}重ねた　手のひら　ぎゅっと結んで
Dialogue: 5,0:23:04.53,0:23:10.70,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur5}ぼやけた視界に映ったものは
Dialogue: 5,0:23:10.70,0:23:16.75,ED_JP,,0,0,20,,{\fad(240,240)\blur5}悲しいくらいに　美しいんだね
Dialogue: 5,0:23:16.75,0:23:20.88,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur5}彼方明けゆく空
Dialogue: 5,0:23:21.63,0:23:25.39,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur5}目を逸らすんだ
Dialogue: 5,0:23:31.64,0:23:38.52,ED_JP,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur5}Stay in night
Dialogue: 4,0:22:21.57,0:22:27.62,ED_CN,,0,0,115,,{\fad(240,240)\blur5}世间万物 融化夜色之中
Dialogue: 4,0:22:27.62,0:22:32.87,ED_CN,,700,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur5}仿佛重力 也随之消散
Dialogue: 4,0:22:33.63,0:22:39.13,ED_CN,,0,700,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur5}我已着迷 你笑容如火光
Dialogue: 4,0:22:39.13,0:22:43.68,ED_CN,,0,700,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur5}这一夜 我忘了何为寂寞
Dialogue: 4,0:22:45.89,0:22:52.14,ED_CN,,0,0,70,,{\fad(240,240)\an2\blur5}或是无聊 或催人眷恋 都对我尽情诉说吧
Dialogue: 4,0:22:52.73,0:22:54.56,ED_CN,,0,0,50,,{\fad(240,240)\blur5}与我共舞？
Dialogue: 4,0:22:54.56,0:22:58.73,ED_CN,,0,0,50,,{\fad(240,240)\blur5}你我两人 面对无尽的黑暗
Dialogue: 4,0:22:58.73,0:23:04.53,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur5}手拉着手 掌叠着掌 紧紧合为了一体
Dialogue: 4,0:23:04.53,0:23:10.70,ED_CN,,0,0,40,,{\fad(240,240)\blur5}逐渐模糊 的视野里 映射出来的那是
Dialogue: 4,0:23:10.70,0:23:16.75,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur5}那么悲伤 那么凄凉 但又那么美丽啊
Dialogue: 4,0:23:16.75,0:23:20.88,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur5}远方天边 正在泛红
Dialogue: 4,0:23:21.63,0:23:25.39,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur5}我却移开了目光
Dialogue: 4,0:23:31.64,0:23:38.52,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur5}不愿天明
